---
// "NEW ON EVENTHEX — Three New Ways to Run Your Event" section.
// Sits between AISection (dark) and AITestimonials (white) — light bg bridges the seam.
---

<section class="mcp-section" data-mcp-pin>
  <div class="mcp-pin-inner">
  <div class="mcp-container">
    <div class="mcp-intro">
      <span class="mcp-eyebrow">
        <span class="mcp-eyebrow__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M10.5 3c.4 2.6 1.2 4.3 2.4 5.5S15.9 10.1 18.5 10.5c-2.6.4-4.3 1.2-5.6 2.5S10.9 15.9 10.5 18.5c-.4-2.6-1.2-4.3-2.5-5.6S5.1 10.9 2.5 10.5c2.6-.4 4.3-1.2 5.5-2.5S10.1 5.6 10.5 3Z" fill="#4F8CFF"/><path d="M17.5 13c.2 1.3.6 2.1 1.2 2.8s1.5 1 2.8 1.2c-1.3.2-2.1.6-2.8 1.2s-1 1.5-1.2 2.8c-.2-1.3-.6-2.1-1.2-2.8s-1.5-1-2.8-1.2c1.3-.2 2.1-.6 2.8-1.2s1-1.5 1.2-2.8Z" fill="#B08BFF"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="mcp-eyebrow__label">New on EventHex</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="mcp-title">Three New Ways to Run Your Event</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mcp-track-mask">
    <div class="mcp-cards" data-mcp-track>
      <div class="mcp-card">
        <div class="mcp-card__content">
          <span class="mcp-badge">New</span>
          <h3 class="mcp-card__title">Manage Your Events<br />from ChatGPT &amp; Claude</h3>
          <p class="mcp-card__desc">Connect your AI assistant to EventHex and just say what you need — it happens.</p>

          <ul class="mcp-checklist">
            <li><span class="mcp-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span><strong>&ldquo;Create a two-day summit with three ticket tiers&rdquo;</strong> — the event exists, tickets and all</span></li>
            <li><span class="mcp-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span><strong>&ldquo;Move the keynote to 11 and update the speakers&rdquo;</strong> — the agenda updates itself</span></li>
            <li><span class="mcp-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span><strong>&ldquo;How are VIP sales this week?&rdquo;</strong> — instant answers from your live event data</span></li>
          </ul>

          <a href="/book-a-demo/" class="mcp-btn">Connect Your AI</a>
        </div>

        <div class="mcp-card__visual">
          <div class="mcp-glass">
          <div class="mcp-terminal">
            <div class="mcp-terminal__bar">
              <span class="mcp-dot mcp-dot--red"></span>
              <span class="mcp-dot mcp-dot--yellow"></span>
              <span class="mcp-dot mcp-dot--green"></span>
              <span class="mcp-terminal__title">Claude — connected to EventHex</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mcp-terminal__body">
              <p class="mcp-terminal__prompt">
                <span class="mcp-terminal__caret" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
                Create a two-day AI summit in Dubai, add three ticket tiers with early-bird pricing, and publish the website.
              </p>
              <p class="mcp-terminal__line"><span class="mcp-check mcp-check--dark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>Event created</strong> — "Dubai AI Summit 2026" &middot; Nov 18&ndash;19</p>
              <p class="mcp-terminal__line"><span class="mcp-check mcp-check--dark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>Tickets</strong> — Standard, Pro, VIP &middot; early-bird until Oct 1</p>
              <p class="mcp-terminal__line"><span class="mcp-check mcp-check--dark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>Website</strong> — 3 designs generated &middot; brand color from your logo</p>
              <p class="mcp-terminal__line"><span class="mcp-check mcp-check--dark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>Published</strong> — live with SEO</p>
              <div class="mcp-terminal__result">
                Done. Registrations are open at <span class="mcp-terminal__link">dubaiaisummit.eventhex.ai</span> — want me to draft the launch campaign next?
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wa-card">
        <div class="wa-card__content">
          <span class="mcp-badge">New</span>
          <h3 class="wa-card__title">WhatsApp Concierge — The Assistant That Lives Where Attendees Already Are</h3>
          <p class="wa-card__desc">No app download required. Attendees message your event's WhatsApp number and get:</p>

          <ul class="wa-checklist">
            <li><span class="wa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Agenda answers and <strong>AI session recommendations</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="wa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Their <strong>digital ticket &amp; QR</strong> on demand, plus self-set reminders</span></li>
            <li><span class="wa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span><strong>Certificates and event photos</strong> delivered right in the chat</span></li>
            <li><span class="wa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span><strong>Registration via WhatsApp</strong> — form to ticket without leaving the chat</span></li>
          </ul>

          <a href="/whatsapp-event-concierge/" class="wa-btn">See the WhatsApp Concierge</a>
        </div>

        <div class="wa-card__visual">
          <div class="mcp-glass">
          <div class="wa-phone">
            <div class="wa-phone__header">
              <span class="wa-phone__avatar">GS</span>
              <span class="wa-phone__headertext">
                <strong>Global AI Show</strong>
                <small>Event Concierge &middot; online</small>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="wa-phone__body">
              <div class="wa-bubble wa-bubble--out">
                What's next on the agenda for me?
                <span class="wa-bubble__time">10:42 <span class="wa-bubble__ticks">✓✓</span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="wa-bubble wa-bubble--in">
                You're on the AI track 🎯 Up next:<br />
                <strong>Scaling LLMs in Production</strong><br />
                11:00 &middot; Main Stage &middot; Reminder 10 minutes before?
                <span class="wa-bubble__time">10:42</span>
              </div>
              <div class="wa-bubble wa-bubble--out">
                Yes! And show my ticket
                <span class="wa-bubble__time">10:43 <span class="wa-bubble__ticks">✓✓</span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="wa-bubble wa-bubble--in wa-bubble--ticket">
                Reminder set ⏰ Here&rsquo;s your ticket:
                <div class="wa-ticket">
                  <div class="wa-ticket__head">
                    <span class="wa-ticket__event">Global AI Show</span>
                    <span class="wa-ticket__tier">VIP</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="wa-ticket__notch wa-ticket__notch--left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span class="wa-ticket__notch wa-ticket__notch--right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
